{"guid":"wa-1to1-+14078764608-74","timestamp_unix_ms":1778391874853,"direction":"outgoing","service":"whatsapp","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"His apparent partiality had subsided, his attentions were over, he was the admirer of some one else.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"wa-1to1-+14078764608-75","timestamp_unix_ms":1778394079853,"direction":"incoming","service":"whatsapp","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+14078764608","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":" \"Lady Catherine is a very respectable, sensible woman, indeed,\" added Charlotte, \"and a most attentive neighbour.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"wa-1to1-+14078764608-76","timestamp_unix_ms":1778403324853,"direction":"outgoing","service":"whatsapp","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Their other engagements were few, as the style of living of the neighbourhood in general was beyond the Collinses' reach.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"wa-1to1-+14078764608-77","timestamp_unix_ms":1778407297853,"direction":"outgoing","service":"whatsapp","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"I have nothing either to hope or fear, and nothing to reproach him with. She has been allowed to dispose of her time in the most idle and frivolous manner, and to adopt any opinions that came in her way.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"wa-1to1-+14078764608-78","timestamp_unix_ms":1778408190853,"direction":"incoming","service":"whatsapp","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+14078764608","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"These are conditions which, considering everything, I had no hesitation in complying with, as far as I thought myself privileged, for you.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"wa-1to1-+14078764608-79","timestamp_unix_ms":1778418721853,"direction":"outgoing","service":"whatsapp","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Elizabeth had never been more at a loss to make her feelings appear what they were not.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
